{"id":"n80760-1-8","stage":5,"title":"판명 · 查明","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80760-1-8-1","ko":"인터넷에서 화제가 된 유에프오 사진 봤니?","zh":"你看过网上热议的那张UFO照片吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"인터넷에서","meaning":"互联网","explanation":"인터넷：互联网；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70774","senseId":"1","lemma":"인터넷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화제가","meaning":"话题","explanation":"화제：话题；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"화제","audio":"/audio/1f7e2fb6cc245d3a31f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87601","senseId":"1","lemma":"화제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"된","meaning":"感到","explanation":"되다：感到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"7","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유에프오","meaning":"飞碟，不明飞行物","explanation":"유에프오：飞碟，不明飞行物","readings":[{"term":"유에프오","audio":"/audio/30c1a16fee2f236396aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70604","senseId":"1","lemma":"유에프오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤니?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"020698f8f7c78429","term":"인터넷","zh":"互联网","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3","entryId":"70774","definition":"连接全世界的电脑使其可以互相交换信息的巨大电脑通信网。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1f7e2fb6cc245d3a","term":"화제","zh":"话题","audio":"/audio/1f7e2fb6cc245d3a31f9.mp3","entryId":"87601","definition":"可谈论的材料或素材。","pronunciation":["화제"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"感到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"处于某种心理状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"30c1a16fee2f2363","term":"유에프오","zh":"飞碟，不明飞行物","audio":"/audio/30c1a16fee2f236396aa.mp3","entryId":"70604","definition":"无法判断真实来源的飞行体，一般推测为来自地球外世界。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/90200bd3bd3361a8896b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80760-1-8-2","ko":"그 사진은 합성으로 판명이 났대.","zh":"据说那张照片是合成的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진은","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합성으로","meaning":"合成","explanation":"합성：合成；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"합성","audio":"/audio/bb07fb7499eafc9729ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84617","senseId":"1","lemma":"합성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"판명이","meaning":"查明，弄清","explanation":"판명：查明，弄清；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"판명","audio":"/audio/2f11a5659b70cf4232f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80760","senseId":"1","lemma":"판명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났대.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"bb07fb7499eafc97","term":"합성","zh":"合成","audio":"/audio/bb07fb7499eafc9729ad.mp3","entryId":"84617","definition":"两个或两个以上的东西合为一个。","pronunciation":["합썽"]},{"id":"2f11a5659b70cf42","term":"판명","zh":"查明，弄清","audio":"/audio/2f11a5659b70cf4232f1.mp3","entryId":"80760","definition":"将某事分辨清楚。","pronunciation":["판명"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d253e9e21f435b169b45.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.289,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80760","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1157,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["据说那张照片是合成的。","去哪儿买菜呢？","你看过网上热议的那张UFO照片吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["据说那张照片是合成的。","你看过网上热议的那张UFO照片吗？","去哪儿买菜呢？"],"answer":0}]}
